<div class="section prose">
  <p class="eyebrow">About Bibo</p>
  <h1>Everyday things, chosen carefully.</h1>
  <p>
    Bibo is a small catalogue of home essentials: storage, kitchenware, lighting, textiles and
    everyday decor. Good design shouldn't only live in expensive stores, so we pick pieces that
    are easy to coordinate, made for daily use, and priced for everyday buying.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every product is chosen with the rest of the catalogue in mind: warm neutrals, natural
    materials, and shapes that sit well together. A few small additions can make a real
    difference without turning into clutter.
  </p>

  <h2>Shipping &amp; returns</h2>
  <p>
    Orders over €40 ship free; everything else has a flat €4.99 shipping rate. Unused items in
    their original packaging can be returned within 30 days.
  </p>

  <div class="button-row">
    <%= link_to "Explore the catalogue →", products_path, class: "button" %>
  </div>
</div>
